      "description": "Probabilidad de inferencia con marca de límite; roja al cruzarlo.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-meter\"><div class=\"ds-track ds-over\"><span class=\"ds-fill\" style=\"width:74%\"></span><span class=\"ds-limit\" style=\"left:45%\"><span>límite</span></span></div><p class=\"ds-pct\">74 %</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-meter{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.4rem;min-height:5rem;margin-bottom:1.9rem;color:var(--ink,#f7f7fb)}.ds-track{position:relative;flex:1;height:1.7rem;border-radius:.85rem;background:var(--deep,#0e1022);border:1px solid var(--line,#363c6b)}.ds-fill{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;border-radius:inherit;background:var(--accent,#ae81fd);transition:background .25s}.ds-over .ds-fill{background:var(--bad,#ff5d6c)}.ds-limit{position:absolute;top:-.55rem;bottom:-.55rem;width:4px;margin-left:-2px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--ink,#f7f7fb)}.ds-limit span{position:absolute;top:calc(100% + .15rem);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:750}.ds-pct{margin:0;min-width:4.4ch;text-align:right;font-size:5rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
